sp_diode at area 0: VACASK warns and uses 1, ngspice-45 has no device (R91 F23, run115)
// VACASK (dhxz6l3…-vacask-unstable-2026): "area must be positive, using 1 instead", v1:flow(br) = -2.485624539216190e-06; ngspice-45 (diode_area_zero.cir): i(v1) = -5.00000000000e-13.
load "spice/diode.osdi"
load "spice/capacitor.osdi"
model vs vsource
model c sp_capacitor
model dm sp_diode is=1e-14
v1 (a 0) vs dc=0.5
d1 (a 0) dm area=0
control
  options rawfile="ascii" reltol=1e-9
  analysis op1 op
endc
